I want to have kids with you.

1428
01:28:24,169 --> 01:28:26,888
Kids who have your eyes...

1429
01:28:27,049 --> 01:28:28,402
...and your lips...

1430
01:28:28,969 --> 01:28:30,243
...and my...

1431
01:28:30,969 --> 01:28:33,005
...last name.
That's all I wish on them.

1432
01:28:35,209 --> 01:28:37,564
Please marry me, Linda.

1433
01:28:42,969 --> 01:28:46,405
Before I make my decision,
you have to do something for me.

1434
01:28:49,929 --> 01:28:52,966
<i>You have to kiss me</i>
<i>in front of all these people!</i>

1435
01:28:58,729 --> 01:29:00,526
You can do it, David!

1436
01:29:02,409 --> 01:29:04,525
Give her a five-second Frencher!

1437
01:29:08,289 --> 01:29:10,439
Kiss her, David.

1438
01:29:11,329 --> 01:29:12,967
Kiss her, David.

1439
01:29:14,769 --> 01:29:16,521
Kiss her, David!

1440
01:29:17,409 --> 01:29:19,479
Kiss her, David.

1441
01:29:26,649 --> 01:29:28,719
Go Yankees!

1442
01:29:45,369 --> 01:29:47,485
Dave's a dirty boy.

1443
01:29:49,569 --> 01:29:51,161
That wasn't so bad, was it?

1444
01:29:51,569 --> 01:29:55,767
I can't believe you actually
started to fall for that crazy man.

1445
01:29:55,929 --> 01:29:58,204
Buddy's not such a bad guy.

1446
01:30:03,369 --> 01:30:06,520
Congratulations! You just graduated
from anger management!

1447
01:30:28,209 --> 01:30:30,677
I'm glad your car died.
The train's romantic.

1448
01:30:30,849 --> 01:30:32,328
Don't change the subject.

1449
01:30:32,489 --> 01:30:37,119
You're telling me the past two weeks
of my life was just therapy?

1450
01:30:37,329 --> 01:30:38,523
Well...

1451
01:30:38,849 --> 01:30:39,838
Yeah.

1452
01:30:40,169 --> 01:30:42,239
I met with Buddy
after reading his book...

1453
01:30:42,409 --> 01:30:45,606
...and I told him about some
of the things going on in your life...

1454
01:30:45,809 --> 01:30:50,564
...and how upset it was making you
and how nuts it was making me.

1455
01:30:52,169 --> 01:30:55,366
He said that he thought he could help,
but it would be tough.

1456
01:30:55,529 --> 01:30:57,440
<i>So how much of this thing was a
<i>setup?</i>

1457
01:30:57,689 --> 01:31:01,807
<i>Well, the guy in your seat on the</i>
<i>plane, the flight attendant, the judge...</i>

1458
01:31:01,969 --> 01:31:03,880
<i>... they're all friends of Buddy's.</i>

1459
01:31:04,049 --> 01:31:07,280
<i>What about the air marshal</i>
<i>who tasered me? Was he in on it?</i>

1460
01:31:07,449 --> 01:31:09,201
<i>No, he was just having a bad day.</i>

1461
01:31:09,369 --> 01:31:11,837
Son of a bitch.

1462
01:31:23,089 --> 01:31:25,239
Skipper, how you doing?

1463
01:31:27,169 --> 01:31:30,081
Buddy Rydell, you're a great man.

1464
01:31:30,369 --> 01:31:33,600
I was just doing my job.
I never doubted you for a minute.

1465
01:31:33,929 --> 01:31:36,159
Except when Galaxia had ahold of you.

1466
01:31:38,009 --> 01:31:40,239
Did you just call that guy
Buddy Rydell?

1467
01:31:41,609 --> 01:31:44,328
A guy named Buddy Rydell
left this card...

1468
01:31:44,489 --> 01:31:46,047
...on what's left of my Lexus!

1469
01:31:46,209 --> 01:31:48,677
Oh, yeah. For insurance purposes.

1470
01:31:48,849 --> 01:31:50,760
Your insurance was canceled!

1471
01:31:53,009 --> 01:31:54,761
Grenada!

1472
01:31:55,569 --> 01:31:58,800
Don't point that gun at Buddy.
I'm the one who smashed your car up.

1473
01:31:58,969 --> 01:32:00,038
- Dave?!
- No!

1474
01:32:00,249 --> 01:32:01,682
I'm sick of guys like this.

1475
01:32:01,849 --> 01:32:04,079
You wanna mess with my friends,
shoot me first.

1476
01:32:04,249 --> 01:32:05,443
- Don't!
- Are you crazy?

1477
01:32:05,769 --> 01:32:06,884
Settle down.

1478
01:32:07,049 --> 01:32:09,609
Butt out! Tough guy's
going to learn a lesson.

1479
01:32:10,889 --> 01:32:14,086
I'm not afraid. Dr. Rydell taught me
not to be afraid of anybody.

1480
01:32:16,489 --> 01:32:18,559
Can I ask you a question, though?

1481
01:32:26,889 --> 01:32:28,481
Got you!

1482
01:32:32,329 --> 01:32:35,207
Dr. B, Davey just pulled a joke on us!

1483
01:32:35,369 --> 01:32:37,599
And how does that
make you feel, Lou?

1484
01:32:49,289 --> 01:32:51,041
Chuck.

1485
01:32:51,209 --> 01:32:53,598
We were just doing a joke.
That's my friend.

1486
01:32:53,769 --> 01:32:55,122
Are you okay?

1487
01:32:58,849 --> 01:33:01,204
He feels stunning.

1488
01:40:41,689 --> 01:40:42,678
Subtitles by
SDI Media Group
